This round predates the lint's typed findings file. `results/spira-lint.findings.jsonl` was
written from the `member=<id> <rule>: <path>:<line>: <message>` lines of `results/spira-lint.out`,
which names the member each finding falls on; its `rule_source` is the rule's name under
`spira-lint/src/rules/`, written for the conversion and not recorded by that round; the findings attribute by
their path. Read the `.out` for the original text.
The findings file is kept as `spira-lint.findings.jsonl.txt`, because no `.jsonl` is tracked here; a replay stages it as `.jsonl`.
